--- !u!114 &60154311
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 60154304}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3fd40d0cb91311a4eab624c1106eb747, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  useEvents: 0
  promptMessage: Talk To Professor Bhan
  askNameDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - Ah, you must be the young civil engineer I've been expecting.
    - You may already have some knowledge about engineering.
    - But knowledge and experience are two different things.
    - <b>Arcadia</b> will give you the chance to put what you've learned into practice
    - Every project you complete will teach you something new.
    - Before we begin, what should I call you?
  fetchAlmanacDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - <b>{PlayerName}...</b>
    - A fitting name for someone beginning an engineering journey.
    - You'll be working on real bridge projects soon.
    - But first, there is something important you will need.
    - There is a book called the <b>Almanac.</b>
    - It will become your engineering record throughout your journey.
    - It won't only record your achievements.
    - It will also record the lessons, discoveries, and projects you encounter.
    - Go to the other room and retrieve it.
  reminderAlmanacDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - Still looking for it? It should be right over there on the desk.
    - We can't start building without the Almanac, {PlayerName}!
  rewardDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - Good.
    - Keep the <b>Almanac</b> with you.
    - From now on, whenever you discover something important, check your <b>Almanac.</b>
    - It will grow alongside your experience.
    - 'Before we begin working, there is one thing you must never forget.

'
    - Safety.
  finalHouseDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - Good.
    - An engineer should always remember that construction is a responsibility.
    - Now you're ready to <b>begin.</b>
    - Let us go outside and let me show you how to build.
  advancesTutorial: 1
  requiredAlmanacTutorialId: Sequence_Alamnac
  houseTutorialId: Sequence_House
  reviewAlmanacDialogue:
    name: Professor Bhan
    sentences:
    - Before we continue, open the <b>Almanac</b> and review it.
    - It will serve as your engineering record throughout your journey.
  npcWalker: {fileID: 60154312}
  rewardHatID: EngineeringHardHat
  rewardDisplayName: Engineer's Hard Hat
  rewardSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7eb9485ad6d6bb044950b089ba81afcc, type: 3}
  onFinalDialogueFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 1298933108}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: DoorTransition, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: UnlockDoor
        m_Mode: 1
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
